% Method mapping for SAFETY_LAYER_V5_PLAN.md:
% - bastani2019modelpredictiveshielding: one learned-policy action followed by
%   a predicted backup motivates one-decision commitment.
% - wabersich2023predictivebarrier: soft-constrained predictive recovery
%   motivates the sampled constraint-deficit ranking.
% - eriksen2019branchingcourse: feedback course/speed trajectory generation
%   motivates course-holding candidates.
% - chen2021backupcbf: forward integration under a feedback backup motivates
%   recomputing course-control actions along each predicted trajectory.
% The finite sampled adaptations do not inherit the papers' formal guarantees.
% The four course samples and +/-30-degree offsets are engineering choices.

