% New v5 sideslip-rescue source, Sec. II.B and Eq. (14):
% beta = atan2(v, u), course = heading + beta.
% The implementation uses this kinematic compensation only, not the paper's
% adaptive LOS law or stability proof; low-speed drift can violate its small,
% constant-sideslip assumptions. Existing hard trajectory checks still apply.
